## D6 "Family at Camp"

iOS is the source of truth — ported `Features/Guardian` (model, service,
observer, full view, embedded card, child/program components).

- **Model** (`data/guardian/GuardianUpdate.kt`): `GuardianUpdatesData`
  (childRegistrations, checkIns, teams, programs) with `checkIn(id)`,
  `team(userId)`, `currentPrograms(now)`, `upcomingProgram(now)`;
  `GuardianChildUpdate` (attendee + checkIn + team + teamMember + scoresVisible →
  `isCheckedIn`, `personalScore`); `snapshots(...)` derivation (dedupe across
  roster / fetched regs / fallback, sort by name, score gated by
  `winnerRevealPolicy.areScoresHidden`). `ChildParticipant.toCampAttendee()`.
- **Service** (`data/guardian/GuardianUpdatesService.kt`): owns no query logic of
  its own — composes the existing services. Per-child `registrations/{id}` +
  `checkIns/{id}` single-doc gets (the blanket queries are RBAC-denied for a
  guardian), `TeamService` (live), `ScheduleService` (public). `observeUpdates`
  loads the static inputs once, then re-emits on every team-score change.
  `FakeGuardianUpdatesService` + Hilt binding. No new Firestore collection.
- **ViewModel** (`ui/guardian/GuardianUpdatesViewModel.kt`): resolves candidate
  child ids (camp roster ∪ the guardian's family list), streams composed data,
  derives snapshots; sealed `GuardianUpdatesUiState`
  (Loading/Error/Empty/Loaded), single owned listener. Read-only.
- **Screen** (`GuardianUpdatesScreen.kt`): per-child `GuardianChildDetailCard`
  (avatar + age/church, check-in row with QR/Manual method, team row with score /
  "Scores hidden" / "Not assigned to a team yet") + "Today at camp" program card
  (happening-now / up-next from the live schedule). Loading/Empty/Error states.
- **Card** (`GuardianUpdatesCard.kt`): self-silencing pine-gradient summary
  embedded in the camp detail — rendered only when the viewer registered a child
  here (detail VM exposes `guardianChildAttendeeIds`); the card's own VM loads the
  per-child summary rows; taps open the read-only screen.
- **Navigation**: typed route `AppRoute.CampingGuardianUpdates`
  (`campings/{id}/family-at-camp`) + destination; `authenticatedUser` +
  `onOpenFamilyAtCamp` threaded through `CampingDetailScreen`.
- **i18n**: guardian strings added to EN, FR, PT-BR.

## Notes / deviations

- Implemented under `ui/guardian/` + `data/guardian/` (matching the iOS
  `Features/Guardian` naming) instead of the TODO's `ui/family/camp/` path.
